        "id": 5255
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-05-09T16:16:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we have a `const` version of this method? Maybe less important because it\u0027s not a public API? Still helpful to make sure we\u0027re not modifying it here.",
